win-pty (a fork of agent-pty)
=============================

Original work and the core Pty/tmux design and API:
    AakeshF — https://github.com/AakeshF/agent-pty

This repository ("win-pty") is a fork that adds native Windows support (MSYS2 tmux driven
from native Windows Python, with PowerShell 7 panes). The Windows port — the
changes in agent_pty/session.py and agent_pty/io.py for cygwin-tmux
compatibility, plus everything under windows/ and the *_win/_wrapper smoke
tests — is by:
    Sam Dotson

The upstream project does not carry an explicit license. This fork is published
to share the Windows port and credits the original author above; it claims no
rights over the upstream code. If you intend to reuse the code, please consult
the original author regarding licensing.
